    "detailed_description": "<strong>GET READY FOR THE TOP ANIME FIGHTING BULLSHIT EXPERIENCE!!</strong><br>Giant kaijus, evil corporations and mighty heroes clash in New Spice City...<br>BUT WE DON'T GIVE A CRAP ABOUT THOSE, enjoy the laid back story of our cast of superpower losers and their toxic relationships. Don't worry, they tend to solve it with their fists all the time.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2545390/extras/6f3e8920b41cbed528743d4eb33be9be.poster.avif?t=1696276801\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2545390/extras/6f3e8920b41cbed528743d4eb33be9be.webm?t=1696276801\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2545390/extras/6f3e8920b41cbed528743d4eb33be9be.mp4?t=1696276801\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br><strong>-WOW THOSE GRAPHICS!!</strong><br>You know when you're watching My Hero or Jujutsu, the screen starts flashing with pencil strokes and you say &quot;Shit's about to go on crack&quot;.<br>Lucky for you, ALL OUR ARTISTS ARE ON CRACK and the game is fully drawn by hand in 2D animation. You're welcome.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2545390/extras/47ddc8c28aaa8f4219fa3eccfbdae4c3.poster.avif?t=1696276801\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2545390/extras/47ddc8c28aaa8f4219fa3eccfbdae4c3.webm?t=1696276801\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2545390/extras/47ddc8c28aaa8f4219fa3eccfbdae4c3.mp4?t=1696276801\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>-WANNA MASH BUTTONS?</strong><br>Don't worry! Forget taking an engineering degree to do a Hadoken, in FrostFire we have 1 button specials, like in Smash Bros or Fantasy Strike.<br>Still, if not letting your opponent play is what you like, you can still do Twitter clip combos, so knowledge is still key to master your character!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2545390/extras/b57456abb3257ad6559bcdf3479041a0.poster.avif?t=1696276801\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2545390/extras/b57456abb3257ad6559bcdf3479041a0.webm?t=1696276801\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2545390/extras/b57456abb3257ad6559bcdf3479041a0.mp4?t=1696276801\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br>Buy the game already, all funds will be spent on paying a psychologist for Shadow.",
