o a Hadoken, in FrostFire we have 1 button specials, like in Smash Bros or Fantasy Strike.<br>Still, if not letting your opponent play is what you like, you can still do Twitter clip combos, so knowledge is still key to master your character!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2545390/extras/b57456abb3257ad6559bcdf3479041a0.poster.avif?t=1696276801\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2545390/extras/b57456abb3257ad6559bcdf3479041a0.webm?t=1696276801\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2545390/extras/b57456abb3257ad6559bcdf3479041a0.mp4?t=1696276801\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br>Buy the game already, all funds will be spent on paying a psychologist for Shadow.",
